WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.663
<v Narator>Earth has its own cycles.

2
00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:10.728
<v Narator>Every flowing stream and every fallen leaf has a place in the journey of life.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.401
<v Narator>Cities grew, industries expanded, and consumption rose.

4
00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:24.513
<v Narator>In 2023, the world generated an estimated 2.1 billion tonnes of municipal solid waste.

5
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.795
<v Narator>Yet humanity did not stand still.

6
00:00:33.545 --> 00:00:38.104
<v Narator>People sorted, cleaned, recycled and educated.

7
00:00:38.854 --> 00:00:40.887
<v Narator>Their efforts made a difference,

8
00:00:41.637 --> 00:00:44.843
<v Narator>but the challenge remains immense.

9
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:54.566
<v Narator>In Indonesia, more than 34 million tonnes of waste were recorded in 2025.

10
00:00:55.226 --> 00:01:01.152
<v Narator>Each year, an estimated 19 to 23 million tonnes of plastic waste enter aquatic ecosystems worldwide.

11
00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:03.640
<v Narator>Is there still hope?

12
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.275
<v Gaia>I am Gaia.

13
00:01:11.775 --> 00:01:14.982
<v Gaia>I have witnessed the journey of your civilization.

14
00:01:15.482 --> 00:01:21.581
<v Gaia>I feel every wound left upon the land, in the rivers and in the air.

15
00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.989
<v Gaia>Humanity has tried to heal me.

16
00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:33.631
<v Gaia>Yet my wounds keep growing.

17
00:01:34.131 --> 00:01:37.184
<v Gaia>I do not need more promises.

18
00:01:37.684 --> 00:01:39.867
<v Gaia>I need action.

19
00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:48.850
<v Gaia>I call you not for your wealth, power or status.

20
00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:52.124
<v Gaia>I still believe humanity can change.

21
00:01:52.624 --> 00:01:55.053
<v Gaia>Will you help me?
